# S22b, member c (k10, slot 2): west with the others; leaves by matz02 with a at @270 s; in stag0102 leaves alone by
# matz01 at @331 s, during b's catch-up.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@92
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-308,-190}
wander -315 -197 4 until epoch>=@270
log a and c leave
mat matz02 yes 2 until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102 with a
wander 345 120 10 until epoch>=@331 fail stagechange
log c leaves alone
mat matz01 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log back in stag0101
idle until frames>=600
